{"id":"1617e481ba305017","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-nonmonotone-stages.md","title":"Cumulative Nonmonotone Iteration","display":"df-nonmonotone-stages — Cumulative Nonmonotone Iteration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-nonmonotone-stages","aliases":["18-df-nonmonotone-stages"],"display":"df-nonmonotone-stages — Cumulative Nonmonotone Iteration","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Definitions 13.1.1 and 13.1.3; Lemma 13.1.2","source_printed_pages":"333–334","source_pdf_pages":"341–342","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-proof-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-nonmonotone-stages"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-nonmonotone-stages</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nonmonotone-stages — Cumulative Nonmonotone Iteration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definitions 13.1.1 and 13.1.3; Lemma 13.1.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"333–334"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"341–342"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-proof-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在 ZFC 元理论中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> 是任意算子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\omega_1\">\\(\\Omega=\\omega_1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\Omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(S\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^\\alpha\">\\(\\Gamma^\\alpha\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\">\\(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\\)</span> 通过以下超限递归同时定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\">\\(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}\\)</span> 采用足以达到停滞的集合指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega,\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega,\\omega_1\\)</span> 及可数性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma^+(S)&amp;:=S\\cup\\Gamma(S),\\\\\n\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\alpha}\\Gamma^\\xi,\\\\\n\\Gamma^\\alpha&amp;:=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\\cup\\Gamma(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}),\\\\\n|\\Gamma|&amp;:=\\min\\{\\sigma&lt;\\Omega\\mid\\Gamma^\\sigma=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\sigma}\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\Omega}\\Gamma^\\xi.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma^+(S)&amp;:=S\\cup\\Gamma(S),\\\\\n\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\alpha}\\Gamma^\\xi,\\\\\n\\Gamma^\\alpha&amp;:=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\\cup\\Gamma(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}),\\\\\n|\\Gamma|&amp;:=\\min\\{\\sigma&lt;\\Omega\\mid\\Gamma^\\sigma=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\sigma}\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma^{&lt;\\infty}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\Omega}\\Gamma^\\xi.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definitions 13.1.1、13.1.3。每阶段都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的子集，递归有唯一值。若所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma&lt;\\omega_1\">\\(\\sigma&lt;\\omega_1\\)</span> 都严格增长，就可取每个新层的最小自然数，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的单射，矛盾。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Gamma|\">\\(|\\Gamma|\\)</span> 的最小值存在。</p>\n<p>一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^\\sigma=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\sigma}\">\\(\\Gamma^\\sigma=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\sigma}\\)</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\ge\\sigma\">\\(\\tau\\ge\\sigma\\)</span> 作超限归纳即得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^\\tau=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\sigma}\">\\(\\Gamma^\\tau=\\Gamma^{&lt;\\sigma}\\)</span>。这复现 Lemma 13.1.2 的证明，且说明集合指标版本与原书写成全序数并的类记法给出同一结果。停滞只依赖累积加入，不依赖单调性；不能删掉 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\">\\(\\Gamma^{&lt;\\alpha}\\)</span> 这一项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega,\\omega_1$ 及可数性取 [[18-df-ordinal]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega=\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^{<\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^{<\\infty}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega,\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma^+(S)&:=S\\cup\\Gamma(S),\\\\\n\\Gamma^{<\\alpha}&:=\\bigcup_{\\xi<\\alpha}\\Gamma^\\xi,\\\\\n\\Gamma^\\alpha&:=\\Gamma^{<\\alpha}\\cup\\Gamma(\\Gamma^{<\\alpha}),\\\\\n|\\Gamma|&:=\\min\\{\\sigma<\\Omega\\mid\\Gamma^\\sigma=\\Gamma^{<\\sigma}\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma^{<\\infty}&:=\\bigcup_{\\xi<\\Omega}\\Gamma^\\xi.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma<\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"|\\Gamma|","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^\\sigma=\\Gamma^{<\\sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\ge\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^\\tau=\\Gamma^{<\\sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^{<\\alpha}","display":false}],"bytes":2153,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d350807688805b1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma^+(S)$、$\\Gamma^{<\\infty}$ 按 [[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]。"},{"id":"03fd31ede57cedbe","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$，$\\Omega=\\omega_1$；$\\Gamma^\\alpha$、$\\Gamma^{<\\alpha}$、$|\\Gamma|$、$\\Gamma^{<\\infty}$ 取 [[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]。$P_\\Gamma$、$\\sigma_\\Gamma$、$\\nu_\\Gamma$ 与 $r_\\Gamma$ 由下式引入，分别作为生成集、闭包序数、入层范数及其全域扩展的记号；不预先假定范数存在。扩展中的 $\\Omega$ 是大于全部实际入层序数的指定哨兵值。$n\\in\\omega$，$\\alpha,\\beta<\\Omega$。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]"},{"id":"0c0fb68cd36bfc03","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"算子取一般输入时，仍可用 [[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]] 的累积阶段得到膨胀算子的固定点。这样的固定点不能自动视为原算子 $\\Gamma$ 的固定点。"},{"id":"267d66ca73221e94","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 元理论中，$\\Gamma:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$，$\\Omega=\\omega_1$；阶段取 [[18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]，$P_\\Gamma,\\sigma_\\Gamma,\\nu_\\Gamma,r_\\Gamma$ 取 [[18-df-inductive-norm]]。$R_\\Gamma,S_\\Gamma\\subseteq\\omega^2$ 是下式定义的非严格与严格阶段比较关系；$x\\preceq_\\Gamma y$、$x\\prec_\\Gamma y$ 为相应的中缀缩写。$x,y,z\\in\\omega$。集合论有序对 $\\langle x,y\\rangle$ 仅作为关系的元素，不是算术语言中的数码。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-nonmonotone-stages|18-df-nonmonotone-stages]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b"]}